    "description": "This is an incredible opportunity to own a detached 3-plex in the Inner Mission. 2984 is a spacious primary unit featuring gorgeous hardwood floors, craftsman details and incredible bay windows allowing the unit to be basked in natural light. 2 bedrooms, a proper living and family room plus large kitchen and dining area. There is also a finished basement with an additional bedroom and undefined room. 2986 features 2 apartments, Unit A is vacant and faces Folsom St. New carpets, large bedroom, living area, and a generous-sized kitchen with a balcony. Unit B is tenant occupied, 1 Bed, 1 Bath. There is also a vacant garret with exposed beams and a single bedroom and bathroom. Bookending this property is a 3-car detached garage, and large flat outdoor yard."
